WEBVTT

00:30:28.440 --> 00:30:30.806
It's, like, a beach town.

00:30:30.830 --> 00:30:32.396
AG: Are you a surfer?

00:30:32.420 --> 00:30:35.136
JW: No, I've got two little kids. (Laughs)

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:39.586
So mom life is how I spend my spare time,

00:30:39.610 --> 00:30:40.993
chasing them around.

00:30:41.920 --> 00:30:44.454
AG: But at work, she found herself
getting distracted

00:30:44.478 --> 00:30:46.389
by another kind of surfing.

00:30:47.130 --> 00:30:49.926
JW: Oh, I was definitely
an internet surfer.

00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:54.486
Online shopping, talking to my friends.

00:30:54.510 --> 00:30:55.748
This is really bad,

00:30:55.772 --> 00:30:58.384
but I used to do
our grocery shopping online

00:30:58.408 --> 00:30:59.866
and it gets delivered.

00:30:59.890 --> 00:31:02.040
AG: I love the efficiency of that, though.